IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cma-registration`

-- Control of Manufacture Act 1959, ss 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 11, 14 and the Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_control-of-manufacture-act-1959.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Schedules and s 2`

#ASSERT `the goods are specified goods` `beer or stout`
#ASSERT `the goods are specified goods` `drawn steel products`
#ASSERT `the goods are specified goods` `chewing gum`
#ASSERT NOT `the goods are specified goods` `oral dental gum that is a health product`
#ASSERT `the goods are specified goods` `cigarettes`
#ASSERT NOT `the goods are specified goods` `wine`
#ASSERT NOT `the goods are specified goods` `furniture`

#ASSERT `the activity is manufacture` `making the goods or a part of them` FALSE
#ASSERT `the activity is manufacture` `altering, finishing, cleaning, assembling or processing the goods` FALSE
#ASSERT `the activity is manufacture` `adapting the goods for sale` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is manufacture` `adapting the goods for sale` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is manufacture` `buying and reselling the goods unchanged` TRUE

