#ASSERT `the registration may be transferred` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the registration may be transferred` FALSE

#ASSERT `the Minister must consent to a transfer` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Minister must consent to a transfer` FALSE

#ASSERT `the appeal lies to` `a refusal to register` EQUALS `the Minister`
#ASSERT `the appeal lies to` `a condition of registration` EQUALS `the Minister`
#ASSERT `the appeal lies to` `a revocation` EQUALS `the General Division of the High Court`

